      'By the end of this lesson, you\'ll know how to evaluate, hire, and work with financial advisors, understanding fiduciary vs. suitability standards, fee structures, red flags, and how to build a professional wealth management team.',
      'Comparison of advisor fee structures and their impact on portfolio growth over 30 years',
