      'Advisor B is the better choice. Fee-only advisors have no commission conflicts and their recommendations are never influenced by which products pay them the most. The lower 0.5% fee versus 1%+ effective cost compounds into hundreds of thousands in savings. Always choose fee-only fiduciary advisors.'
