    whatsNext('Wealth Management Capstone','All Courses Complete!','Congratulations! You have mastered all 12 courses in the Euphoria financial literacy pathway. You are now equipped with comprehensive knowledge spanning investing, personal finance, economics, corporate finance, strategy, analytics, behavioral finance, accounting, quantitative analysis, risk management, alternative investments, and wealth management.',0)
