      {prompt:'If behavioral coaching (1.5% of Advisor Alpha) closes half the gap (1.75%), your net return becomes 8.25%. $500K at 8.25% for 20 years = $2.42M. The advisor saves you approximately:',options:['$250,000','$450,000','$650,000','$150,000'],correct:2}
