      'The 1.5-2.0% annual TLH benefit comes from daily scanning and instant execution. A human advisor might review portfolios quarterly and catch major losses. An algorithm checks every position every day, executing swaps whenever a meaningful loss exists. Over a year, these small, frequent harvesting events compound into significant tax savings, $7,500-$10,000/year on a $500K portfolio.'
