      { takeaway: 'Tax-loss harvesting is the killer app', detail: 'Automated TLH adds 1.5-2.0% annually, generating a 6-8x return on the 0.25% robo-advisor fee. Direct indexing amplifies this by 2-3x through stock-level harvesting. No human can scan 500+ stocks daily for tax opportunities.' },
      { takeaway: 'The hybrid model wins', detail: 'Robo-advisor for daily management + fee-only planner for complex strategy + AI for planning tools + limited emerging tech = optimal stack. Technology handles what algorithms do best; humans handle what requires judgment, empathy, and context.' }
